<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Plants, fish, birds, and animals and man,</l><l>All things created God through His Word.</l><l>If you look upon the face of all the land,</l><l>Only one can love the Lord.</l><l>The only one is man!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
